---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../normalize.css";
import "../shared.css";
import "../privacy-policy/privacy-policy.css";
import "../terms/terms.css";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Terms and Conditions - Iron Wing Dispatching"
    description="Terms and conditions for Iron Wing Dispatching services, including text messaging program terms and verbal opt-in consent."
>
<main>
            <section class="privacy-policy terms">
                <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
                <p>
                    <strong>Last Updated:</strong>
                    11/4/2026
                </p>
                <p>
                    These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of
                    <strong>iron-wing-dispatching.com</strong>
                    and the dispatching services offered by
                    <strong>Iron Wing Dispatching</strong>
                    ("Company," "we," "us," or "our"). By using our website or
                    services, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree,
                    please do not use them.
                </p>

                <h2>1. Our Services</h2>
                <p>
                    We provide dispatching services to owner-operators and small
                    motor carriers, including load sourcing, rate negotiation,
                    route planning, and administrative support. We act on your
                    behalf as your dispatcher. You remain the motor carrier of
                    record and stay solely responsible for operating your
                    equipment, driving safely, complying with hours-of-service
                    and other laws, and maintaining your authority, insurance,
                    and permits.
                </p>

                <h2>2. Fees</h2>
                <p>
                    Our fee is a percentage of the linehaul rate on each load we
                    book for you. Fuel surcharge is not included in the fee
                    base. Current plans are published on our website. The
                    Essential Plan is 5% and the Full-Service Plan is 10% of the
                    linehaul rate. We may change published pricing for future
                    loads, and any change will not affect loads already booked.
                </p>

                <h2>3. No Contract, Cancel Anytime</h2>
                <p>
                    There is no long-term contract. You may stop using our
                    services at any time by notifying us by phone or email. Fees
                    remain due on any load we booked before you cancelled.
                </p>

                <h2>4. No Guarantee of Earnings</h2>
                <p>
                    Freight markets change constantly. We work to find
                    profitable loads, but we do not guarantee any level of
                    revenue, load volume, or rates.
                </p>

                <h2>5. Your Responsibilities</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Provide accurate and current information about your
                        business, equipment, and authority.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Keep your insurance, registrations, and certifications
                        valid.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Review rate confirmations and dispatch instructions
                        before accepting a load.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2 id="sms-terms">6. Text Messaging Program Terms</h2>
                <p>
                    This section applies to text (SMS) messages from Iron Wing
                    Dispatching. It is part of these Terms and should be read
                    with our
                    <a href="/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.
                </p>

                <h3>A. Program Description</h3>
                <p>
                    <strong>Program name:</strong>
                    Iron Wing Dispatching Dispatch Messages
                </p>
                <p>
                    If you agree to receive texts, we send operational messages
                    related to our dispatching services, such as load offers and
                    availability, rate confirmations, dispatch instructions,
                    pickup and delivery updates, scheduling, document requests,
                    account and service notices, and replies to your questions.
                    We do not send third-party advertising, and we do not use
                    this program for unrelated marketing.
                </p>

                <h3>B. How You Consent (Verbal Opt-In)</h3>
                <p>
                    We collect consent to text you
                    <strong>verbally</strong>, during a phone call or voice conversation between you and
                    an Iron Wing Dispatching representative. We do not enroll a
                    phone number that has not given consent. Before enrolling
                    your number, our representative reads the following, or
                    words to the same effect, and waits for your clear
                    agreement:
                </p>
                <blockquote>
                    "Do you agree to receive text messages from Iron Wing
                    Dispatching at this number about your dispatching services,
                    such as load offers, rate confirmations, and dispatch
                    updates? Message frequency varies. Message and data rates
                    may apply. You can reply STOP at any time to cancel or HELP
                    for help. Consent is not a condition of using our services.
                    You can read our Terms and Privacy Policy at
                    iron-wing-dispatching.com."
                </blockquote>
                <p>
                    We keep a record of your consent, including your phone
                    number, the date and time, and the representative who
                    obtained it. After you agree, we send a confirmation text
                    that repeats the program name, the message frequency, how to
                    get help, how to opt out, and that message and data rates
                    may apply. Giving consent is optional and is not a condition
                    of purchasing or using any of our services.
                </p>

                <h3>C. Message Frequency</h3>
                <p>
                    Message frequency varies with your activity, such as the
                    number of loads we are working on for you.
                </p>

                <h3>D. Costs</h3>
                <p>
                    Message and data rates may apply. Your mobile carrier sets
                    these charges. We do not charge you for texts.
                </p>

                <h3>E. How to Opt Out</h3>
                <p>
                    You can cancel at any time. Reply
                    <strong>STOP</strong>
                    to any message. You may also tell us by phone at (817)
                    865-3016 or by email at info@iron-wing-dispatching.com.
                    After you opt out, we send one message confirming your
                    request and then stop texting you. To rejoin, reply
                    <strong>START</strong>
                    or give consent again by phone.
                </p>

                <h3>F. Help</h3>
                <p>
                    Reply
                    <strong>HELP</strong>
                    to any message, call (817) 865-3016, or email
                    info@iron-wing-dispatching.com.
                </p>

                <h3>G. Carriers and Delivery</h3>
                <p>
                    Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered
                    messages. Delivery is not guaranteed. Supported carriers and
                    features may change.
                </p>

                <h3>H. Your Information</h3>
                <p>
                    We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile phone number or
                    text-messaging consent with third parties or affiliates for
                    their marketing or promotional purposes. See our
                    <a href="/privacy-policy.html#sms-privacy">
                        Privacy Policy
                    </a>
                    for details.
                </p>

                <h2>7. Website Use</h2>
                <p>
                    You agree not to misuse our website, attempt to gain
                    unauthorized access to it, or submit false information
                    through our forms.
                </p>

                <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
                <p>
                    The content, logo, and design of this website belong to Iron
                    Wing Dispatching or its licensors. You may not copy or reuse
                    them without our written permission.
                </p>

                <h2>9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
                <p>
                    Our website and services are provided "as is" and "as
                    available," without warranties of any kind, to the fullest
                    extent permitted by law.
                </p>

                <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
                <p>
                    To the fullest extent permitted by law, Iron Wing
                    Dispatching is not liable for indirect, incidental, or
                    consequential damages, including lost profits, lost loads,
                    or detention, arising from your use of our website or
                    services. Our total liability for any claim will not exceed
                    the fees you paid us in the three months before the claim
                    arose.
                </p>

                <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
                <p>
                    These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of
                    Wyoming, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.
                </p>

                <h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
                <p>
                    We may update these Terms from time to time. Changes take
                    effect when posted on this page with a new date. Continued
                    use after a change means you accept it.
                </p>

                <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>
                    <strong>Email:</strong>
                    info@iron-wing-dispatching.com
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Phone:</strong>
                    (817) 865-3016
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Address:</strong>
                    30 N Gould St, Sheridan, WY 82801
                </p>
            </section>
        </main>
</BaseLayout>
